      "intent": {
        "task": "Preserve and solve both distinct readings of 'same speed' without declaring either the original settled interpretation.",
        "source_solution": "For unchanged respective speeds,first distancesa,b satisfya-b=2,a/b=vA/vB and ratio of remaining times25/16=(a/b)^2,givinga=10,b=8,D18,vA5,vB4. For common post-meetingw,first distancesa=(5/2)w,b=(8/5)w;difference2 givesw20/9,D82/9. Pre-meeting rates depend on unknown common meeting time and have ratio25/16,not uniquely fixed.",
        "unit_reason": "One paired complete result tests the mathematical difference between unchanged respective rates and a common adopted rate, plus which rates the data actually determine.",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": ["Original 'same speed' interpretation remains unresolved; both explicitly defined models are reviewed conditionally.", "Result recognition does not demonstrate independently constructing both models and their equations."],
        "figure_observations": []
