        "task": "Determine ordered full-route times with correct arrival-delay direction and joint meeting rate.",
        "source_solution": "ForT1>T2, T1-T2=5/3 and1/T1+1/T2=1/2. SubstitutionT2=s gives3s^2-7s-10=0,positive root10/3. ThusT1=5,T2=10/3 hours;negative root-1 excluded.",
